  "description": "\"What you gave me wasn't a name. It was a curse.\" \n\nAbandoned on a remote island because she stood in the way of her mother's remarriage, she spent years longing for a home she could never return to. When she finally escaped, she had no idea that a dangerous predator was already closing in. A mysterious man soon appeared, his unsettling obsession turning her freedom into another nightmare. When he discovered her desperate attempt to escape through death, he whispered a chilling threat: \n\n\"If you're planning to die, then give yourself to me instead. I'll play with you until I'm bored, and then I'll devour you.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon :**    \nR15 : [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498027202)    \nR19 : [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498027179)",
